      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: the cutover repository has three branches — master (consumed by portable, tmux source only), openbsd-git (raw filtered OpenBSD history), and an orphan automation branch holding the GitHub Actions workflow so workflow files are not merged into portable."
    },
